{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Publish payload files atomically.** Writing directly to the final digest path can leave a truncated file if the invocation stops mid-write. Subsequent retries encounter the existing file, reject its content, and permanently wedge the execution. Write and flush a temporary sibling, atomically move it to the final path, safely handle an already-published valid target, and clean up temporary files. Add tests for interrupted writes and concurrent publishers.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7obqgL","finding_digest":"ea1865e60763a408772e2ddde369930b419ac9619b80e0b84b525e9c2743c0ef","finding_id":"arf_v1_5imglzqhmosaq5zofxo6g2mtbn","finding_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::writepayload::non-atomic-publication","identity_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::writepayload::non-atomic-publication","line":230,"observation_digest":"1ddc994bde58afc2c3462545d39404055d7d808bdb7eaf58596594a64b1138ff","observation_id":"aro_v1_dxojss66lcx4fq2gevc5hfaeav","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/FileSystemSerDes.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5imglzqhmosaq5zofxo6g2mtbn","published_at":"2026-09-01T00:06:38Z","review_id":"arr_v1_swuzzg2xzxfg5tzjagsvyuypmi","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"63774560bbe19ce24572aef440359a0d966b4cca","reviewer":"codex","start_line":225,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":672},"record_id":"art_v1_sgbwibkkzw3jvksnswiqfif2bq","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T00:06:38Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
